{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年58歲的1986年港姐亞軍吳婉芳自1993年與富商胡家驊結婚後就淡出幕前，兩人育有大仔胡智略（Caspar）、二仔胡智同（Lynus）及孻女胡智晴（Helene），當中有「鑽石級筍盤」之稱的胡智同本月23日正式「封盤」，與女友低調舉行婚禮，吳婉芳、細妹胡智晴及「歌神」張學友都有到場見證。胡智同今日（5月28日）在Instagram分享多張婚禮美照，曝光新娘子結婚最美的一面，胡智同更在宣誓時爆喊，場面感人！</p><figure><img alt=\"吳婉芳二仔胡智同結婚，張學友驚喜現身。(大大大大發@小紅書)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135141403127451648895732.jpeg/4VNIeXnOuqtOAn9OU8GrCfLDIBAaKNqZYJHjrGCR46w\"/><figcaption>吳婉芳二仔胡智同結婚，張學友驚喜現身。(大大大大發@小紅書)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳婉芳大仔胡智略（Caspar）、二仔胡智同（Lynus）及細女胡智晴（Helene）。(IG：@lynuswoo)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240826/904802011323568128841523.jpeg/lo4P-NB_YONsjrLfrhzgtbUltkCMD3vyK2sBOytrATs\"/><figcaption>吳婉芳大仔胡智略（Caspar）、二仔胡智同（Lynus）及細女胡智晴（Helene）。(IG：@lynuswoo)</figcaption></figure><p>胡智同曬婚照宣誓喜極而泣</p><p>胡智同在Instagram曬出多張婚禮美照，胡智同以「the best friend（最好的朋友）」稱呼太太。從相片中可見，胡智同與太太穿上唐裝和旗袍，在豪車前影相，新娘子又高又靚，與胡智同相當合襯。另一張相中見到，胡智同在宣誓時喜極而泣，在眾人面前拭淚，場面感動。期間吳婉芳穿上紅色端莊裙子及紅鞋，挽住兒子的手走出酒店，又挽手影大合照，與兒子關係融洽，優雅貴氣。</p><figure><img alt=\"胡智同今日分享婚照。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664099871002624329140.png/SeNIX9j3qkQ4IKyW_DNi8F5e0wuJQYT1SGtmokhrZqI\"/><figcaption>胡智同今日分享婚照。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"胡智同今日分享婚照。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664119693807616804529.png/oi10CMUfiGJAdXd9EBKt2DfYVfKQf986JnflbyZ35W8\"/><figcaption>胡智同今日分享婚照。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拭淚。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664117164511232179346.png/CldkiZHG9uSYxxDkv8lF3HrkqsGIbKWHNnK8CDZyvAg\"/><figcaption>拭淚。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"與兩隻愛犬。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664114773626880178230.png/7S8pky1R0JHTIisp53z4e1ZYQbs19l2E4HZHNeB2RzU\"/><figcaption>與兩隻愛犬。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好多人。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664112311439360296840.png/QdMAZhLv4P9nP7RlWkplhzKQBYR0ev8SgBZcSYAWXEk\"/><figcaption>好多人。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳婉芳挽胡智同手陪伴兒子。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664109471764480910654.png/ou5nexAHT0gwgkMEoG_2NureakvQ5F7HUwHVQVMB1UE\"/><figcaption>吳婉芳挽胡智同手陪伴兒子。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兄弟團！（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664119412789248205379.png/fD3soaWYNj_77wXT9iNtXn9ehECJ1Uam1pdpXtaXaV4\"/><figcaption>兄弟團！（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兄弟團！（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664116921241600709345.png/dfK2zMHLTi6YyoMk5rkfYQnn9qg24rix2QRAGNkEQBg\"/><figcaption>兄弟團！（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳婉芳好靚！（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664114446471168841396.png/2Nur6Xleey0ad8C251mueSP25RuyR-xL4W2UkeFtlJE\"/><figcaption>吳婉芳好靚！（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新娘子美！（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664111850065920679231.png/irtcP0rg__JHKERd0ng7vDnr44MYk_bBE9ZDHRPWQx0\"/><figcaption>新娘子美！（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"合照。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664109245272064259671.png/TCLilldVb7HMYBVe95bSMDMM03iEjXsCqfxfcKn8X3A\"/><figcaption>合照。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"合照。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664120071294976639281.png/DzB4qRlAOHfUlekdRLtptL5hnXeBDjbk5kPi9uZD4vY\"/><figcaption>合照。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"胡智同結婚。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664117550387200072416.png/8Q2unjOdyadL6owkhZ8Vk0BCqK8EgqiOHxv8SR8b_Ek\"/><figcaption>胡智同結婚。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚禮上的照片。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664115255971840863924.png/t7hIBBSreEbanT7aNwMQEYu780xvNW806WKUkOlilJA\"/><figcaption>婚禮上的照片。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台上飲酒搞氣氛！（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664112600846336548910.png/mKJ6uZjEgd8fAfeoxAbj9FwuR4pS41T2abxtrGm8baw\"/><figcaption>台上飲酒搞氣氛！（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"感動！（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664108909727744029561.png/j40lXDHqR9LnAiH0rY4nGAW0VG2TgA8tmK0jUpitI1I\"/><figcaption>感動！（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開心。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664115591778304403217.png/qoVpsThaYfD3rBb30CGYWVm6C6j5ttxhKbd1ECm3dRA\"/><figcaption>開心。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開心。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664113318334464372184.png/nyRMS9sCVyo5iuXTR7rq-qFhAAfZYz1jSXG_1Ulxv9U\"/><figcaption>開心。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"場面感人。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664110839369728064952.png/sC74W_wj85zKz-E7QUVcDRDrBvzNNBBqA2YqigNmKoo\"/><figcaption>場面感人。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擁抱親朋好友！（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664107827728384780649.png/ZuIbAWwhwaPvkcnyzBf8raerNyljcy1ZM9_nrDPf56w\"/><figcaption>擁抱親朋好友！（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"胡智同分享婚照。（IG@lynuswoo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136664105692696576485623.png/8I6F4_oVnpW0n46iDrUBeSjjUUVHg99-6G0edOhtHnQ\"/><figcaption>胡智同分享婚照。（IG@lynuswoo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-28T06:20:35.509649+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":907,"images":23,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}